{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt in a multimodal multiprofile setup using ViT image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.520 (F1: 0.479) is significantly lower than the prior scvi_n200-based configuration (0.725 accuracy), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may impact performance. Uncertainty remains about whether other factors or alternative configurations could yield better results, as this comparison isolates only the RNA encoder change."
}

